    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>Calm spread in waves through adrenaline and panic.</em></p><p>As an <strong>action</strong>, you exhale a dream of how this could end quietly.</p><ul><li>Each hostile creature of your choice within a <strong>4 squares-radius sphere</strong> centered on a point you can see within 12 squares must make a <strong>Soul check</strong> (DC = 8 + your tier + your Soul or Presence modifier; choose when you gain this subclass).</li><li>On a failure, the creature’s aggression is <strong>suppressed</strong> for <strong>1 round</strong>: it cannot take the Attack action or cast manifestations that deal damage, and its movement cannot bring it closer to your allies than it already is.</li><li>This effect ends for a creature if it is attacked or takes damage.</li></ul><p>You don’t erase the reasons; you just give them one quiet breath to reconsider.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
